{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>開心果熱潮冇停過！台灣嘅人氣手搖飲品專門店「開心茶事」憑住招牌「開心果奶蓋」爆紅，官方預告佢哋要登陸香港啦！「開心茶事」嘅最大特色，在於其將開心果融入特製綿密奶蓋之中，店家每日嚴選優質開心果磨成濃郁果醬，再調製出香氣十足、口感厚實順滑嘅「開心果奶蓋」。更有充滿台灣特色嘅「開心果粉粿」，充滿香醇堅果香，開心果迷必食！雖然香港店詳情尚未公布，但已經好期待啦！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740012322259497_14896620036a898fbbd5086.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740012539553828_11210764636a898fbdea473.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740012751994055_3183014526a898fc011332.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740012954739789_20063578076a898fc214256.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740013162773787_5308350556a898fc486461.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740013411376167_4193579386a898fc6d4cdd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178740013630268713_4257829556a898fc9bde48.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T12:19:11.573625+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}